{"3368250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Delicious - The First Course", "steam_appid": 3368250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Emily on a tasty Time Management adventure! Step back in time to discover the restaurants that helped shape Emily into the talented chef and restaurateur she is today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a longtime fan or new to her world, you can now explore the origins of Emily's cooking journey across 8 unique restaurants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Emily as she masters a variety of cuisines—from comforting American classics to vibrant Mexican dishes and bold Indian flavors. With your help, Emily will hone her cooking skills and whip up delicious dishes to serve to hungry customers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle 80 Time Management cooking levels and unlock Endless mode for infinite culinary fun. Challenge yourself with a variety of engaging mini-games, hire handy waitstaff, upgrade menu items, decorate each restaurant, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏰ <strong>80 Time Management levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your multitasking skills to the test in 80 fast-paced cooking levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍕 <strong>8 unique restaurants</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 8 different locations, each with its own charm and character!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💞 <strong>Endless levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock an infinite number of levels for non-stop culinary creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌮 <strong>Global cuisines</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whip up delicious dishes from around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥟 <strong>Engaging mini-games</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a variety of challenging mini-games that add an extra layer of 